.Dt PQCAP-ENTER 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pqcap-enter
.Nd first-pass Capsicum wrapper
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar command
.Op Ar args ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Limits stdio with
.Fn caph_limit_stdio ,
enters capability mode with
.Fn caph_enter ,
then
.Fn execvp
the command.
Not Casper.
Not
